# bad_touch.part -- A cylinder that touches a block at one point
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# After fuzzer finding 0019, two solids that touched at a point and went
# out as one part.

profile p along z -5 0 0 2 0 0 2 10 0 -5 10 0
extrude blk from 7 to 12 p
circle c along x 3 6 2
extrude rod from 2 to 8 c
union u blk rod
